<title>USA: Limited Inc names new division's head.</title>
<headline>Limited Inc names new division's head.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Limited Inc said Tuesday it named Marie Holman-Rao, formerly of Gap Inc's Banana Republic unit, as president of its new division Limited Design Services Inc in New York.</p>
</text>
